      "message": "docs(site): search box in the docs header\n\nThe Zola site builds its search index (search_index.en.js) and the header\nbox searches it with a vendored, MIT-licensed elasticlunr. Results are a\nkeyboard-accessible dropdown (arrow keys, Enter, Escape), and their links\ncome from base_url, so the site stays correct under /Camcraft on Pages.\n\nFixes #1245\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
